@url=http://localhost:3000

### Login (guarda el token para usarlo abajo)
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fede@correo.com",
  "password": "hola1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Listar vehículos
GET {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar filtrando por marca
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?marca=for
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear vehículo (debe dar 201)
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Ford",
  "modelo": "Cargo 1722",
  "patente": "ab123cd",
  "anio": 2020,
  "capacidadCarga": 8000
}

### Crear con datos inválidos (debe dar 400)
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "",
  "modelo": "Cargo",
  "patente": "123",
  "anio": 1800,
  "capacidadCarga": -5
}

### Ver un vehículo
GET {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar un vehículo
PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Ford",
  "modelo": "Cargo 1722",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2021,
  "capacidadCarga": 8500
}

### Sin token (debe dar 401)
GET {{url}}/vehiculos

### Vehículo inexistente (debe dar 404)
GET {{url}}/vehiculos/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar un vehículo (debe dar 204)
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}